rent examData.examId."}, {"id": "formatDate", "label": "formatDate helper", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "366-370", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Returns 'TBA' for null/empty strings and otherwise uses toLocaleDateString with en-IN locale to format dates as 'day Mon yyyy'."}, {"id": "tabs_config", "label": "Tab configuration", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "376-389", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Array of 12 tab descriptors (id, label, icon) covering overview, dates, eligibility, pattern, syllabus, vacancy, cutoff, postdetails, preparation, updates, pyp, and faq."}, {"id": "SSC_CGL", "label": "SSC CGL (Combined Graduate Level) Exam", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "21-80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Domain entity: SSC CGL is a 4-tier national exam for Group B/C posts in Indian government, with eligibility of Bachelor's degree, age 18-32, and 11 specific posts including AAO, ASO, Inspector, Auditor, UDC, Tax Assistant."}, {"id": "SSC_CHSL", "label": "SSC CHSL (Combined Higher Secondary Level) Exam", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "81-121", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Domain entity: SSC CHSL is a 3-tier national exam for Group C posts (LDC, JSA, DEO, DEO Grade A) requiring 12th pass, age 18-27."}, {"id": "SSC_Conducting_Body", "label": "Staff Selection Commission (SSC)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "34, 93", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recurring domain entity representing the conducting body for both CGL and CHSL examinations."}, {"id": "AuthContext_provider", "label": "AuthContext (useAuth)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "4, 221", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Imported from shared/providers/AuthContext.jsx to retrieve the current user via useAuth; user is destructured at component mount but not visibly consumed in render."}, {"id": "Breadcrumb_component", "label": "Breadcrumb common component", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "5, 425-431", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reusable breadcrumb from shared/components/common/Breadcrumb rendered with Home, Exams, and examData.title trail."}, {"id": "dataService_module", "label": "dataService module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aggregates getExamCategories, getExams, getTestSeries, getTests, api, getExamUpdates, and getExamYearlyData into the page's data layer."}, {"id": "lucide_react_icons", "label": "lucide-react icon set", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "7-17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bulk import of ~50 lucide-react icons used for tab indicators, hero stats, and section headers."}, {"id": "yearlyData_state", "label": "yearlyData state", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "234, 373", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renamed setter setUpdatesData actually stores a year-keyed map; currentYearData is derived by indexing into it with selectedYear."}, {"id": "data_merge_strategy", "label": "Data merge strategy (dynamic > static)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "282-318", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Architectural decision: dynamic exam info from DB (description, eligibility, ageLimit, syllabus) takes precedence over STATIC_EXAM_CONTENT values, with explicit field-by-field override inside a nested 'static' object on mergedExamData."}, {"id": "tier_based_pattern", "label": "Tier-based exam pattern (CGL Tier I-IV, CHSL Tier I-III)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "24-28, 84-87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Domain concept: exams are structured as sequential tiers (CBT objective, CBT objective, descriptive pen-paper, skill/typing test) and the UI splits syllabus rendering into tier1/tier2 tables."}, {"id": "year_selector_pattern", "label": "Year selector pill UI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "446-470", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "UI design pattern: rounded pill buttons switch selectedYear, with a 'NEW' badge for 2026 and a pulsing dot beside the result status text."}, {"id": "sticky_tab_nav", "label": "Sticky horizontal tab navigation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "543-566", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Design pattern: tabs are sticky on top, scroll horizontally, and use an active gradient underline as the selected indicator."}, {"id": "mobile_floating_nav", "label": "Mobile floating quick-nav (React Portal)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "1458-1507", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Uses createPortal from react-dom to mount a fixed-position floating action button with a popup tab menu directly into document.body, escaping parent overflow/z-index containers."}, {"id": "localstorage_bookmarks", "label": "localStorage bookmark persistence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "336-337, 348-355", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Architectural decision: bookmarked exam IDs are stored in localStorage as a JSON array under 'bookmarkedExams'; the page reads them on mount and writes on toggle. No server sync."}, {"id": "category_based_filtering", "label": "Category-based related exam filtering", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "288-301", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pattern: related exams are filtered by matching categoryId and excluding the current examId, sliced to 4; related test series are filtered by category, sorted with isPinned first then by admin order, sliced to 6."}, {"id": "vacancy_breakup_widget", "label": "Vacancy category-breakup widget", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "1166-1193", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renders UR/OBC/SC/ST counts with per-category color palettes (blue/amber/emerald/purple), a percentage progress bar, and a year-on-year comparison bar chart."}, {"id": "syllabus_table_layout", "label": "Syllabus table with totals", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "655-737, 766-846", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Syllabus data is presented in tables with a tfoot that reduces questions/marks/time to totals; the pattern tab also shows four summary cards for tier-1 (questions, total marks, minutes, negative marking)."}, {"id": "pyp_download_list", "label": "Previous Year Papers download list", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "1268-1294", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Renders a hardcoded list of years 2020-2025 with download icons, indicating static UI for PYP even though the actual click handler is not implemented."}, {"id": "faq_accordion", "label": "FAQ accordion", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "E:\\Tech\\Testprep\\Trstprep V2.1\\apps\\frontend\\src\\pages\\exams\\ExamInfoNew.jsx", "source_location": "1296-1325", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Na